item.content:encoded:
Just as Fremont is a place of diversity, so is the <a href="https://www.anglicancommunion.org">Worldwide Anglican Communion</a> of which we are a part. The Rev. Bright Singh David, a priest from South India and <a href="https://www.gtu.edu">GTU</a> Doctoral student, has begun a new ministry in partnership with St. Anne's and the <a href="http://www.diocal.org">Diocese of California</a> to meet the needs of Indian Anglican Christians in the area.

Rev. Bright Singh celebrates a Eucharist every first and third Saturday of each month at 4:30 p.m. He is also working with Rev. Jeff to put together events that help us continue to learn more from God together and about God from each other.

&nbsp;
